  title: The Famine
  narration:
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f3fdb36aa88284bc1bd8f644f90f5ad8, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Long ago, a great famine came to the land. Every pot was empty and every field was dry."
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fda82eb5781d04c2caa072b37e83846f, type: 3}
    subtitle: "But Ajá the dog never looked hungry. Each night he sang a secret song, and a rope came down from the sky."
